# Files and directories kept out of the release ZIP.
#
# `make package` copies the tree with `rsync --exclude-from=.distignore`, so
# these are rsync patterns: a leading slash anchors to the package root, and an
# unanchored rule matches at any depth (which is why `test/` also removes a
# nested test directory, wherever it turns up).
#
# The bundled editor under dist/static/ is a release artifact and must stay in
# the package -- see ADR-0001. Do not add a `dist` rule here.

# VCS and CI
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.distignore

# Agent instructions and skills. Skills live in .agents/skills/, with
# .claude/skills/ symlinking to them; neither belongs in a published module.
.agents
.claude
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Editor and local tooling leftovers
.aider*
.DS_Store
.env

# Build inputs. Only the built editor in dist/static/ ships; the editor
# checkout it is built from does not.
/exelearning/
vendor/
themes/

# Tests, their caches, and the coverage reports they write
test/
test/.phpunit.result.cache
test/.phpunit.cache/
artifacts/

# Development tooling and configuration
phpmd.xml
codecov.yml
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
composer.json
composer.lock
blueprint.json
renovate.json

# Repository documentation. docs/ holds the ADR/SDD records, not user docs.
docs/

# Packaging output
*.zip
